// Syncthing ignore file for ~/.claude — ALLOWLIST (fail-closed).
//
// Ignore everything, then un-ignore exactly the session state we want synced.
// A denylist would silently start syncing any NEW directory a future Claude
// Code version creates (possibly a token cache) — this fails closed instead.
//
// Tracked in git so both Macs stay identical. Order matters: un-ignores first,
// then the catch-all `*`. NOTE: `*` matches basenames at EVERY level, so a
// synced directory needs BOTH `!/dir` (the dir) and `!/dir/**` (its contents).

!/projects
!/projects/**
!/history.jsonl
.git
*
